## ActionType: 从品牌关联商品

从品牌入口选择商品，建立商品到品牌的归属关系。

### Operation Config

```yaml
operation_config:
  type: relation
  relation_type_id: rel_product_brand
  relation_operation: create
  anchor_role: target
  other_object_condition:
    object_type_id: product
    field: status
    operation: ==
    value_from: const
    value: offline
```


